        "date": "2026-11-15T02:28:21Z"
      },
      "message": "feat(ui): show the machine work envelope in the viewport (Browser checkbox)\n\nThe Browser View door gets \"Show work envelope\". With a machine mounted it\ndraws the tool-tip travel volume as an outline at the setup's work origin:\na box for a mill, a cylinder on the spindle axis for a lathe. The figures\nare the ones the stroke check reads. A machine without travel draws nothing\nand the tooltip names the missing figure. Display state only: no command,\nnot saved, no effect on posting or checks.\n\nFixes #1567\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
